claude-code-go
Copyright (c) 2026 Truto

This module drives the Claude Code CLI over the stream-json control protocol.
Its protocol handling (the control request and response flow, permission
prompts, hook callbacks, in-process MCP servers, the CLI flags and the message
parsing) was ported to Go from Anthropic's Python Agent SDK,
claude-agent-sdk-python 0.2.170 (commit dd27b70), files
src/claude_agent_sdk/_internal/query.py,
src/claude_agent_sdk/_internal/transport/subprocess_cli.py,
src/claude_agent_sdk/types.py and
src/claude_agent_sdk/_internal/message_parser.py:

  https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python

No source was copied; the Go code is new, but its behaviour follows that
SDK. That SDK is distributed under the following licence:

